div class=\"post-meta\"><span>Practical Guides</span><span>1 min read</span></div><h1>Plan One Scene With Candy.ai Build Your Video Presets</h1><p>Map a simple fictional shot to character, action, location and a partner only where the scene needs one.</p><div class=\"byline\"><span class=\"brand-icon\">C</span><div><strong>Candy AI editorial desk</strong><small>Independent editorial analysis</small></div></div></header><div class=\"article-layout\"><aside><div class=\"toc\"><span>IN THIS ARTICLE</span><a href=\"#article-content\">Full analysis</a><a href=\"#sources\">Sources</a><a href=\"#related\">Related reading</a></div></aside><div><div class=\"article-content\" id=\"article-content\"><p>Candy.ai’s Build Your Video guide describes presets for Character, Action, Location and Partner. Start with one scene that can be represented by the choices you see. A single visible action is easier to review than a sequence that needs several characters and camera changes.</p>\n<h2 id=\"fit-a-shot-to-the-available-choices\">Fit a shot to the available choices</h2>\n<p>For a fictional grown-up florist, the goal is a short clip of her carrying a bouquet across a workshop. Pick an available setting that supports the action. If adding a second character makes the object hard to see, revise the scene to one person at the workbench. Use the actual preset names in your note so you can reproduce the selection.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/assets/editorial-candy-build-your-video-preset-shot.png\" alt=\"Select the adult fictional role. Choose one visible action. Give the action a location.\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"check-the-result-against-one-requirement\">Check the result against one requirement</h2>\n<p>Before confirming generation, check the available options and cost. After you get a result, watch for the bouquet staying in the shot and the character being visible at the end. The provider says choices and generated results can vary by preset.</p>\n</div><div class=\"editorial-rule\"><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" rx=\"3\"></rect><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"></path></svg></div><div><strong>Our consent-and-privacy rule</strong><p>Use fictional adults and invented details, keep secrets out of chat, upload only media you created or have permission to use, and inspect deletion and billing before paying.</p></div></div><section class=\"sources\" id=\"sources\"><h2>Sources and verification</h2><p>Primary product and policy materials used to frame this independent comparison. Recheck live features, token costs, renewals, policies, and prices before purchase.</p><ul><li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candy.ai Build Your Video</a></li><li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candy Studio help</a></li></ul></section></div></div></article><section class=\"section related\" id=\"related\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"section-label\">Continue exploring</div><h2>Related Candy AI<br><span>comparisons.</span></h2></div></div><div class=\"post-grid compact\"><article class=\"post-card violet\"><a href=\"/blog/candy-ai-monthly-tokens-not-received-date/\"><div class=\"post-copy\"><div class=\"post-meta\"><span>Practical guide</span><span>3 min read</span></div><h3>Candy AI Monthly Tokens Missing? Check the Replenishment Date</h3><p>Distinguish Candy.ai’s monthly token allocation from annual billing, identify the relevant account date and prepare a missing-credit report.</p><strong>Read the guide <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></strong></div></a></article><article class=\"post-card violet\"><a href=\"/blog/candy-ai-remove-payment-method-only-card/\"><div class=\"post-copy\"><div class=\"post-meta\"><span>Practical guide</span><span>3 min read</span></div><h3>Can’t Remove Your Only Candy AI Payment Method? What to Check</h3><p>Understand the documented active-subscription restriction, distinguish removing a saved card from cancellation, and prepare a precise support request.</p><strong>Read the guide <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></strong></div></a></article></div></section></main><footer><div class=\"footer-grid\"><div><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"brand-icon\">C</span><strong>Candy <span>AI</span></strong></a><p>Independent research on Candy AI girlfriends, custom companions, chat, voice calls, images, video, tokens, privacy, pricing, safety, and alternatives.</p></div><div><h3>Explore</h3><a href=\"/#choose\">Candy AI characters</a><a href=\"/#features\">Chat and media</a><a href=\"/#compare\">Candy AI alternatives</a><a href=\"https://spicy-box.com/?utm_ref=6cc1a8f534d264bd\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Official Candy AI <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a></div><div><h3>Latest guides</h3><a href=\"/blog/candy-build-your-video-preset-shot/\">Plan One Scene With Candy.ai Build Your Video Presets</a><a href=\"/blog/candy-studio-banner-opens-subscriptions/\">Why Candy Studio Might Open the Subscription Page</a><a href=\"/blog/candy-ai-remove-payment-method-only-card/\">Can’t Remove Your Only Candy AI Payment Method? What to Check</a></div><div><h3>Information</h3><a href=\"/about/\">About</a><a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy</a><a href=\"/terms/\">Terms</a><a href=\"/editorial-policy/\">Editorial policy</a><a href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© <span data-year>2026</span> Candy AI</span><span>Independent · Not affiliated with Candy AI</span><span>Adults 18+ · No chat, uploads, or payments collected</span></div></footer><script src=\"/assets/main.js\"></script><div id=\"site-analytics\" data-measurement-id=\"G-FEB4YQ77YY\" data-domain=\"candyai.bond\" data-analytics-mode=\"automatic\" hidden></div><script defer src=\"/analytics-consent.js?v=20261007-auto\"></script></body